{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0023_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "7786e33dfbfe67b692243799757020100e5aaf85c5cd04367b2f7a28d245f706", "ja": "ふう～。{$P$}、\n撮影のお仕事、お疲れさまでしたなの♪", "zh": "呼～{$P$}，\n拍摄工作辛苦了唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0023_1001_p", "source_sha256": "64702a5de9efd56ce3299ccadac55d07589e54a9d2ad3b6dd6a2c48f71485972", "ja": "美希の方こそ、お疲れさま。\n一日中ずっと撮影で大変だっただろ？", "zh": "美希才辛苦了。\n整天都在拍摄，应该很累吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0023_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "28e3f9cc57ec6b8d3d45f905d8d3c7f4d6526d7798cadd7634f780efc8f2ed42", "ja": "ううん、そうでもないよ？\nずーっと{$P$}と一緒だったから♪", "zh": "不会啊，也没那么累～\n因为我一～直和{$P$}在一起呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0023_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d6ebba9f5b603e1c0cef62bf74ba6267fda0b4d497814174a57ce0807ca5b869", "ja": "はは、待ち時間のたびに、お喋りしてたもんな。\nこんなに美希と話ができたのは、久しぶりか……。", "zh": "哈哈，毕竟每到等待时间，我们都在聊天嘛。\n好像很久没跟美希聊这么多了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0023_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "8502978976dadcc079dafd5affa3722b751ad9a39b73fb3a668f8aef8291ab0a", "ja": "うん！　{$P$}はいっつも忙しそうに\nしてて、ミキのこと、ほったらかしだから～。", "zh": "嗯！还不都是因为{$P$}\n一向很忙的样子，把美希放着不管～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0023_1005_p", "source_sha256": "be17647071aa462bf3c1a9cf6aa63d6aa311a08bf2781290d561c88e60b31e29", "ja": "え！？　ご、ごめん、そんなつもりはなかったんだけど\n……美希がそう感じてたのなら、あやまるよ。", "zh": "咦！？抱、抱歉，虽然我无意如此……\n但如果让美希有这种感觉，我是该道歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0023_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "92b6d1c0aca59e758c8d196727e48eec1b3dc9395943eceb9bba368094ae8712", "ja": "あ……。ごめんなさいなの、{$P$}。\n今のはウソ。……ミキ、知ってるから。", "zh": "啊……对不起唷，{$P$}。\n刚才那是骗你的……美希都知道喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0023_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "ab65347653452081fedf72214f823e1d250efad26148b5f480b087343cb577be", "ja": "{$P$}はどんなに忙しくても、\nミキのこと、ちゃんと見ててくれてるって……。", "zh": "{$P$}不管有多忙，\n都会好好看着美希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0023_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "59d2613e905f52859fec9e30bd4a7f18afce6488d1332b026a1fefc80acf37ba", "ja": "あのね。……これからも、ずっとミキを見てて？\nそしたらいつか、きっと……。", "zh": "那个……今后也要一直看着美希喔？\n这样一来，总有一天一定能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0023_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "99223c0ebb817e30665328de41dad7330f6d28e4c599a1197e33b5fb10e153d7", "ja": "{$P$}にだけ、とっておきのミキ……\n見せてあげられるって思うな！　あはっ☆", "zh": "只让{$P$}看到美希最特别的样子……\n美希是这么想的！啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
